            {"id": "war.suggestion.drainage-ask", "sceneId": "war.scene.drainage", "label": "先听两人的理由", "inputDraft": "我让玛拉和托马斯分别说清楚想去避难所和水塔的理由，以及他们真正确定的风险。", "rationale": "两条公开路线没有标准答案，先理解动机有助于作出价值选择。", "groundingKnowledgeIds": ["war.path.drainage-shelter", "war.path.drainage-water", "war.clue.shelter-mark", "war.clue.water-pipe"], "target": {"kind": "DRAFT"}, "tier": "EXAMPLE"},
